0140","kind":"announcement","title":"Simplified Chinese and NEW HERO just arrived!","summary":"Arrr, ye salty fishermen! Steam Next Fest be upon us, and we got a couple o’ fine surprises for ye scurvy lot! New hero on the horizon — the mighty pirate Eliza! With this fierce lass sailin’ alongside ye, all orange trinkets have their effects DOUBLED! Strong as a kraken’s grip, ain’t she? But every treasure has its curse…Eliza gets 1 less bait each day (save for the very first), and she hauls in 1 fewer item than our first hero. Keen to test this sea dog out? Leap into the game right this mome","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:04:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691536","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4210140-1845383656377571","game_id":"steam-4210140","kind":"announcement","title":"Brofish Demo is OUT!","summary":"Hello everyone,After a long and fruitfull Playtest, we're happy to finally announce that the Brofish Demo is now live!This Demo includes every Playtest update and a little bit extra. Be ready to experience core gameplay loop, several ascensions, passive upgrades, unlocks and everything else you can expect from a complete Demo version.We took your Playtest feedback very seriously. We polished and balanced everything as much as we could, but nothing is ever perfect. We welcome all your feedback ad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T13:10:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377571","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4210140-1839041357038879","game_id":"steam-4210140","kind":"announcement","title":"Open Playtest is LIVE!","summary":"Hey everyone, A